---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fedha na Uhasibu — Kitabu Kikuu, Madeni, Ripoti za Fedha"
  description="Uhasibu wa kuingia mara mbili na mpango wa hesabu unaoweza kubadilishwa, sarafu nyingi, upatanisho wa benki, bajeti na ripoti za fedha zinazofuata viwango vya IFRS. Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/uwezo/hasibu/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm"><div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li><a href="/sw/uwezo/">Uwezo</a></li><li aria-current="page">Fedha na Uhasibu</li></ol></nav>
    <h1>Fedha na Uhasibu</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-subtext">Uhasibu kamili wa kuingia mara mbili, kutoka kwa maandishi hadi taarifa za fedha. Kitabu kimoja kikuu, ukweli mmoja, kila muamala ukiweza kufuatwa.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Kwa nani moduli hii</h2>
    <p>Wakurugenzi wa fedha, wahasibu, wakaguzi na wamiliki wanaohitaji hesabu safi, mwonekano wa wakati halisi na ripoti tayari kwa ukaguzi — bila kuhifadhi karatasi za hesabu au kupatanisha mifumo iliyotenganishwa.</p>
    <p>Kama shirika lako linatoa ankara kwa wateja, linalipa wauzaji, lina akaunti ya benki au linaripoti kwa bodi, mdhibiti au mfadhili, moduli hii ndiyo uti wa mgongo wa uendeshaji wako.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Unachoweza kufanya</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Mpango wa Hesabu</h3><p>Mpango wa hesabu unaweza kubadilishwa na kina kisicho na kikundi. Unda vikundi vya hesabu, hesabu za udhibiti na hesabu ndogo. Panga kwa idara, miradi au vituo vya gharama kwa ripoti za usimamizi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Maandishi ya Hesabu</h3><p>Maandishi ya mkono na ya otomatiki na mzunguko wa uidhinishaji. Kila andishi halibadiliki mara moja — marekebisho yanafanywa kupitia maandishi ya kubatilisha ambayo yanahifadhi njia kamili ya ukaguzi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Deni za Wateja</h3><p>Ankara za wateja, mikopo, malipo na ugawaji wa malipo. Umri wa deni kwa kipindi. Toa taarifa za wateja. Fuatilia salio kwa mteja, tawi au eneo.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Deni za Wauzaji</h3><p>Ankara za wauzaji, malipo na mikopo. Pata ankara na risiti za bidhaa. Umri wa deni. Vifurushi vya malipo. Fuatilia kodi ya kuzuia.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Upatanisho wa Benki</h3><p>Patanisha taarifa za benki na maandishi ya kitabu kikuu. Pata mechi za otomatiki au za mkono. Tambua vitu visivyopatanishwa. Simamia akaunti nyingi za benki katika sarafu nyingi.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Sarafu Nyingi</h3><p>Fanya kazi katika UGX, KES, TZS, RWF na sarafu nyingi kwa wakati mmoja. Jedwali la viwango vya ubadilishaji. Faida na hasara zilizopatikana na zisizopatikana. Ripoti katika sarafu ya kazi au ya uwasilishaji.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Usimamizi wa Bajeti</h3><p>Weka bajeti kwa hesabu, idara au mradi. Fuatilia kilichopatikana dhidi ya bajeti na uchambuzi wa tofauti. Funga bajeti baada ya uidhinishaji. Toleo nyingi za bajeti kwa mwaka wa fedha.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Taarifa za Fedha</h3><p>Taarifa ya mapato, sahili, mtiririko wa fedha (kiwango cha IAS 7) na jaribio la usawa. Toa PDF au Excel. Vipindi vya ripoti vinavyoweza kubadilishwa. Maoni ya idara na yaliyopanuliwa.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Jinsi moduli zinavyoungana</h2>
    <p>Moduli ya uhasibu ni kitovu cha mvuto. Kila moduli nyingine inapeleka kwenye kitabu kikuu kwa otomatiki:</p>
    <ul class="connection-list">
      <li><strong>Mauzo</strong> → utambuzi wa mapato na maandishi ya deni za wateja unapotoa ankara</li>
      <li><strong>Hifadhi</strong> → marekebisho ya thamani ya hisa na maandishi ya gharama za bidhaa zilizouzwa</li>
      <li><strong>Manunuzi</strong> → maandishi ya wauzaji yanapopata mechi ya ankara/risiti</li>
      <li><strong>HR na Mishahara</strong> → uhasibu wa mshahara, NSSF, PAYE na net kulipwa</li>
      <li><strong>Uzalishaji</strong> → maandishi ya kazi katika maendeleo na bidhaa za mwisho</li>
      <li><strong>Miradi</strong> → ukusanyaji wa gharama za mradi na utambuzi wa mapato</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Udhibiti na ruhusa</h2>
    <div class="controls-grid">
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Mtengenezaji-Mkaguzi</h3><p>Maandishi ya hesabu yanahitaji uidhinishaji kabla ya kuchapishwa. Sanidi vikomo vya uidhinishaji kwa kiasi au hesabu.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Kufunga Kipindi</h3><p>Funga vipindi vya uhasibu ili kuzuia maandishi ya nyuma. Fungua tena kwa uidhinishaji uliokaguliwa tu.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Njia ya Ukaguzi</h3><p>Kila muamala halibadiliki. Kitabu cha ukaguzi cha INSERT-tu kinarekodi nini kilifanywa, na nani, kutoka IP gani, wakati gani.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Kutenganisha Majukumu</h3><p>Ruhusa tofauti za kuingia, kuidhinisha, kuchapisha na kuripoti. Mtumiaji mmoja hawezi kumzunguko mzima wa muamala.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>Ona kwa macho</h2>
    <p class="screenshot-intro">Picha kutoka mfumo halisi wa Kraal Code — inakuja hivi karibuni.</p>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Mpango wa Hesabu</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Taarifa ya Mapato</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Sahili ya Jumla</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Utendaji wa Bajeti</span><span class="screenshot-note">Picha ya mfumo halisi — inakuja hivi karibuni</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Ona uhasibu kwa vitendo</h2><p>Oma onyesho lililobinafsishwa kwa mahitaji ya uhasibu ya shirika lako.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Oma Onyesho →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:700px}.page-hero-subtext{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);max-width:60ch;margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.container--narrow p{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);line-height:var(--kc-leading-relaxed);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-4)}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.feature-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.feature-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.feature-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list{margin-top:var(--kc-space-4)}.connection-list li{margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-3);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.connection-list strong{color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.controls-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.control-item{padding:var(--kc-space-5);border-left:3px solid var(--kc-teal)}.control-item h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-1)}.control-item p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.screenshot-intro{color:var(--kc-text-secondary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6)}.screenshot-slot{aspect-ratio:16/10}.screenshot-placeholder{width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:2px dashed var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);gap:var(--kc-space-2)}.screenshot-label{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);color:var(--kc-text-primary)}.screenshot-note{font-size:var(--kc-text-xs);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.feature-grid,.controls-grid,.screenshot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
